{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a40298c6-3c4f-852c-8bd5-d872023a597a",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:11:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nadia E. Okafor",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:08:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Newport Recreation, this is Beth, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:08:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Beth. My name is Nadia Okafor. I would like to inquire about the skating area. Is it open at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:09:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Nadia! Oh, the skating. Which one are you thinking of, the outdoor rink setup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:09:11-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the outdoor skating area. I believe it is the one near the park by the water. I apologize, I am driving, so I am on my speaker. I am stuck behind a very slow truck on Route 138 right now, so I have a moment to call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:09:31-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's one way to use the time. No problem at all. Let me pull up what I have. [pause] Okay, so with the nor'easter that ended Saturday, we've had crews busy clearing and checking the parks. I'm showing the skating area isn't fully open yet. They're still looking at the surface and the surrounding walkways."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:09:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. So it is closed today, then. Do you have any idea when it might open?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:10:02-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have a date, honestly. It depends on how the ice and the ground hold up after the storm, and on the staff getting through everything else first. I'd guess later this week, but that's only a guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:10:18-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is understandable. [line breaks up] I am sorry, the connection is poor here. Could you repeat the last part?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:10:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure! I said I don't have a firm date. Probably later this week, but it depends on the conditions."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:10:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I would also like to ask whether there is a web page that has the same information, so that I might check it without calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:10:48-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is. If you go to the City of Newport website and look under the Recreation department, the parks and facilities updates are posted there. Closures and openings usually go up on that page."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:11:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. Would I find it by searching for Newport Recreation, or is there a particular menu to select?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:11:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either works. Searching Newport Recreation will get you there, or from the city homepage click on Departments and then Recreation. Parks are listed right on that page."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:11:22-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is very helpful. I will look it up when I am parked. The truck appears to be turning off finally, so I may actually make my appointment on time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:11:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh good, about time! Drive safe, Nadia."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:11:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I shall. Thank you very much for your assistance, Beth. You have been most kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:11:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anytime. You have a great afternoon, and I hope you get to skate soon!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:11:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T13:11:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now!"
    }
  ],
